# Work-only additions, layered on top of `bundle`.
#
# Installed by `dot init --work` / `dot update` on machines flagged as work.
# This file is additive: everything in `bundle` is installed here too, so
# nothing that belongs on every machine should be duplicated into this file.
#
# Casks are allowed here. (Upstream dmmulroy/.dotfiles calls work-bundle casks
# an anti-pattern and keeps this file formulae-only — we diverge on purpose,
# because Slack is a cask and is genuinely work-only.)

cask "slack"
